# Namazu Elements configuration.
#
# This file is created from the packaged example on first install and is then
# operator-owned: upgrades never overwrite it.
#
# Keep deployment-specific values OUT of this file (Mongo URI, public URLs,
# bootstrap admin credentials). Supply them through the environment instead -
# systemd drop-ins under /etc/systemd/system/namazu-elements.service.d/, with
# underscore keys (dev_getelements_elements_mongo_uri) that translate to the
# dotted properties - because values in this file take precedence over
# environment variables, and a value pinned here would silently shadow the
# deployment's settings.
